    },
    {
      "textEn": "Originally was written the same as 作 (work). The 夂 (foot; movement) component was added later to distinguish the characters. The middle component 乍 was corrupted to look like 古, which caused later writers to reanalyze 做 as a compound of 亻and 故.",
